Dear Contributors,

Thank you very much for the work you do to improve PowerTOP.

In the last few days I've noticed an increasing demand to do git pull
requests from our contributors.  However, PowerTOP doesn't do git pull
requests.

PowerTOP handles bug-fixes and development on patches via the mailing
list.  We appreciate you submitting your code to the mailing list.

Thank you,
Alexandra.

